AudD  ·  profile default
                 │ Run a command
 1 Recognize     │ >                                                                                                   
 2 Listen        │ 
 3 Now playing   │ > completion      Print a shell completion script
 4 Streams       │   docs            Print AudD documentation as markdown
 5 History       │   now-playing     Show the latest songs on your streams
 6 Account       │   recognize       Identify music in files, URLs, and folders
 7 Settings      │   streams add     Add a stream to monitor
 8 Help          │   streams remove  Stop monitoring a stream
                 │   streams report  Plays grouped
